ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 was $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20250701__20251231_zVenZA1IDO1e" title="Depreciation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2025-07-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact001169" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">354</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--Depreciation_dxL_c20240701__20241231_zwCGGOO1jmmf" title="Depreciation::XDX::-"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl1171">0</span></span>, respectively.</span></p>

