weighted average remaining lease term for the operating lease is <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1_iI_dtY_c20251231_z5dvuRvssVzj" title="Weighted average remaining lease term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact002519" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1">2.26</ix:nonNumeric></span> years as of December 31, 2025.</span></p>

