$<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_c20260107__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--ConvertibleDebtMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zU6zFJfKUAm3" title="Conversion price, per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2026-01-07_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002824" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.51</ix:nonFraction></span> per share or $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--CommonStockValue_iI_c20260107__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--ConvertibleDebtMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zATUFnu24HEi" title="Common stock , value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockValue" contextRef="AsOf2026-01-07_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002826" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">200,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, being the closing price of the stock on the date of grant, resulting in a loss on extinguishment of debt
at the time of exchange of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt_iN_di_c20260107__20260107__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--ConvertibleDebtMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zgtewbFublp" title="Loss on conversion of debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" contextRef="From2026-01-072026-01-07_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002828" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" sign="-" unitRef="USD">74,236</ix:nonFraction></span>.</span></p>

